riminal charges/SEC civil action: Sam Lee charged, Rodney Burton/Bitcoin Rodney charged, Brenda Chunga pleaded guilty; DOJ alleges $1.9B worldwide Ponzi fraud, false mining claims, returns .5%-1% daily, collapse in 2022 and withdrawal blocking beginning July 2021. DOJ case page (SRC-002) states charges are allegations and defendants presumed innocent; identifies Lee, Burton, Chunga, aliases and alleged names HyperTech/HyperCapital/HyperVerse/HyperNation."}
